ut one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a well-known research institution, researcher Allen, due to negligence, mistakenly sends confidential information to external personnel. Intern Kate, realizing this mistake, decides not to tell her superiors to protect the reputation of the institution. At the same time, senior engineer Mark knows that Kate understands this leak, but he chooses to remain silent because he has some personal grudges with Allen. When the leakage of confidential information causes significant losses to the institution, Allen feels very shocked and regretful. Later, Kate realizes that she probably should report this incident earlier.\n\n[Question]\nWhat is the possible intention behind Mark's behavior?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mark hopes to see Allen get blamed for the leak, so he chooses not to interfere.\nB. Mark possibly hopes to protect the institution's reputation, worries that his involvement will exacerbate the situation, and decides to watch the situation develop.\nC. Mark possibly thinks that Kate is responsible for reporting this leak, so he does not need to take action.\nD. Mark possibly believes that the institution has enough mechanisms to handle such accidents, so he chooses not to interfere.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0fdd6006945d27fdde2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367741258,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first